            </note>
            <note corresp="#d469-f2" n="2" xml:id="d469-f2-content">
                <p><ref target="#d468"><hi rendition="#italic">Supra</hi></ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d469-f3" n="3" xml:id="d469-f3-content">
                <p>Despatch 423 was a 25-page appraisal of budget and financial data relating to
                    Thailand for the period 1953–1955. Additional supporting detail was provided in
                    nine enclosures attached to the despatch. (Department of State, Central Files,
                    892.10/3–255)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
